WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.811
PDF options. The first three sections are folded to make room.

00:00:05.911 --> 00:00:13.938
JPEG quality: how strongly colour and gray pages are compressed (0 = lossless). Output dpi lowers the resolution to shrink the file.

00:00:14.038 --> 00:00:21.866
Skip blank pages leaves empty pages out of the PDF; Same size for all pages gives every page one size.

00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:26.328
Skip consecutive duplicate pages drops a page identical to the one before it.

00:00:26.428 --> 00:00:33.250
Split PDF at blank pages and at bar-code separator sheets (Code 128) make several PDFs from one batch.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:40.672
Bookmarks adds one bookmark per source file; PDF/A-2b writes an archival PDF with embedded font and colour profile.

00:00:40.772 --> 00:00:50.472
Front-matter pages numbers the first pages with roman numerals; Target PDF size aims for a file size in megabytes.

00:00:50.572 --> 00:00:55.775
PDF author and a password for opening protected input PDFs.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:01:00.235
OCR: tick “Searchable text (OCR) in PDF” to add an invisible text layer; choose the recognition languages.

00:01:00.335 --> 00:01:15.004
Also save text (.txt) and Also save hOCR write the recognised text next to the PDF.

00:01:15.104 --> 00:01:21.466
Segmentation mode tells the recognizer how the page is laid out (columns, single block, single line…).
